  "details": "VRChat is a place where you make friends and socialize. So I thought it would be amazing to add more avatar to avatar toggleable interaction features such as (Hand holding, limb grabbing and such) having your limbs pass through someone just feels a bit empty now. \n\nI know some people will say \"You can do this with physbones\" or whatever, but not everyone has the knowladge to do that and it doesn't always work correctly with physbones. \n\nMore interactions would be nice, thank you.",
